TITLE Mix 50 mM DIC with 50 mM Ca (1:1) and heat 20 to 200C with calcite eq
SOLUTION 1 DIC
    temp 20
    units mmol/kgw
    pH 7 charge
    C(4) 50
SOLUTION 2 Ca
    temp 20
    units mmol/kgw
    pH 7 charge
    Ca 50
MIX 1
    1 0.5
    2 0.5
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 0
REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    20 200 in 10
USER_PUNCH
    -headings Temperature_C Density
    10 PUNCH TC, RHO
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -user_punch true
END
